{"unit_id":"ZeroOT-Liu__dsh-usage-widget#feature-1","repo":"ZeroOT-Liu/dsh-usage-widget","commit":"a42cf712068c6aa3d5ad6989a752d9dae70c5172","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-usage-widget 的功能「侧栏余额与用量摘要」：部件在 DSH 侧栏页脚汇总显示账号余额、赠送余额、今日 token 与本月累计，并可在窄栏中通过提示查看摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:714-742"]}
